This directory contains the single-header Amoeba C implementation of the
Cassowary constraint-solving algorithm, vendored from commit
c79cd288e515366dc1bf70339dc9db03cca12459:

    https://github.com/starwing/amoeba

Amoeba does not currently publish tagged releases. The vendored commit is
therefore pinned explicitly. amoeba.h is unmodified; kitty's Python binding
selects the library's supported double-precision mode with AM_USE_DOUBLE.

To update Amoeba, replace amoeba.h and LICENSE from a reviewed upstream
commit, record its commit ID above, and run the Amoeba binding, layout,
sanitizer, and packaging tests. Keep an Amoeba update in its own commit so the
vendored diff can be audited independently.

Amoeba is distributed under the MIT License in LICENSE.
